<template>
    <heading>DOM declarations</heading>
    <keywords>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>navigation</li>
        <li>toolbar</li>
        <li>Table of Contents</li>
        <li>source</li>
        <li>output</li>
        <li>status</li>
    </keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>These stable pane IDs give the view destinations for navigation, article source, and expanded code. Keeping each pane's scroll container separate lets a reader inspect an expansion without losing their place in the source. Dragging a splitter redistributes the width of its neighboring panes using <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Flexible_box_layout/Basic_concepts">CSS flexbox</a>. <a href="#28.lp5">Reload rereads the selected project</a>; Export remains a placeholder.</p>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>DOM declarations</name>
        <code><![CDATA[<header id="LP5-TopNav">
    <div role="toolbar" aria-label="Main commands">
        <span>LP5</span>
        <button id="LP5-Reload" type="button" disabled>Reload</button>
        <button type="button">Export</button>
        <details id="LP5-DeveloperMenu">
            <summary>Developer</summary>
            <button id="LP5-DeleteDatabase" type="button" aria-label="Delete current database">Delete current database</button>
        </details>
    </div>
</header>
<main id="LP5-Main">
    <nav id="LP5-Toc" aria-label="Table of contents" tabindex="-1"></nav>
    <div class="LP5-PaneSplitter" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical"></div>
    <section id="LP5-Source" aria-label="Source" tabindex="-1"></section>
    <div class="LP5-PaneSplitter" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical"></div>
    <section id="LP5-Output" aria-label="Output" tabindex="-1"></section>
</main>
<div id="LP5-FindBar" role="search" aria-label="Find in selected pane" hidden>
    <label id="LP5-FindScope" for="LP5-FindInput">Find in Source</label>
    <input id="LP5-FindInput" type="search" autocomplete="off">
    <span id="LP5-FindCount" aria-live="polite">0/0</span>
    <button id="LP5-FindPrevious" type="button" aria-label="Previous match" title="Previous match">↑</button>
    <button id="LP5-FindNext" type="button" aria-label="Next match" title="Next match">↓</button>
    <button id="LP5-FindClose" type="button" aria-label="Close find" title="Close">×</button>
</div>
<div id="LP5-SourceContextMenu" role="menu" aria-label="Article operations" hidden>
    <button type="button" role="menuitem">Edit Article</button>
</div>
<div id="LP5-Status" role="status">Ready</div>
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>